{"version":1,"key":"card:241","content":{"id":241,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"什么叫尾调用？尾调用指的是函数的最后一条语句是调用一个函数，例如","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1bf25ab9-6978-47e3-ad49-fc068de4a1c6","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function doSomething() {\n  return doSomethingElse();\n}","collabId":"2703ca09-79bf-4b49-8c7f-4ef2b82a389d","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"94880f45-7736-488c-91d2-17d8bc4e6dae","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"1ecf969b-2a94-4bca-867e-f0098aa8d896"},{"children":[{"text":"我们知道每次调用函数时，都会创建一个栈帧放置到函数栈中，当函数调用较多时，特别是递归调用，可能会使得栈中的栈帧越来越多，当超过栈帧允许的最大数量时，就会报错","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8a24225b-92f6-48c2-b417-48418409da0d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function doSomething() {\n  doSomething();\n}\n\ndoSomething(); // RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded","collabId":"e6111d3d-1664-48fb-8be1-05d6e106c618","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"79e32425-db80-4f57-b075-dcc490a5d655","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f198a5c3-2ae0-4316-89d1-e01d7700bb2e"},{"children":[{"text":"那么所谓的尾调用优化指的是，当函数的最后一条语句是返回另一个函数的调用时，那么调用的函数会复用当前栈帧，而不会创建一个新的栈帧，这样栈中的栈帧的数量就不会增加，也就不会出现超过栈帧允许的最大数量。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c084c5fc-055a-4543-8c87-910a4ba40939","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"要实现尾调用优化，被调用函数要满足以下特点：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"721dfda9-71c7-4554-b44f-79fb913d0737","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"尾调用没有访问当前栈帧中的变量","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d2f9af3f-4bed-4101-82d5-194c64ef343e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"74950a83-ea02-4e10-85c6-e7bcf140ab1f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"尾调用是最后一条语句","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7e5b3263-d60c-4225-a9d0-838543511eab","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"18c02eef-6be3-4480-b072-7bd1cc5b400a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"尾调用的返回值作为函数的返回值","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c3d43ffd-576f-43f4-abaa-6106500a3e15","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"cc7fa813-f73a-4e01-af5f-d5971f4303e6","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"c440cc99-b1cc-4c7e-beab-bc6fca1cb574","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function doSomething() {\n  // 无法优化，没有 return\n  doSomething();\n}","collabId":"3dc6f781-df19-4dd6-ae55-8a370d39882f","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"6a3f3fd8-ae81-48f6-be55-70353ca99db5","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"48be9a75-92fe-442b-a4a9-6c3489714134"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function doSomething() {\n  // 无法优化，尾调用不是最后一条语句，先进行函数调用，然后进行加法\n  return 1 + doSomething();\n}","collabId":"13ed3bd5-3410-46e2-a76a-fccbc13aa343","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"707579f6-9343-4a72-9f0f-40ffc25be86e","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"9d910bb1-1c70-46bc-8124-474badd59458"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function doSomething() {\n  let num = 1,\n  func = () => num;\n  // 无法优化，访问了当前栈帧中的变量\n  return func();\n}","collabId":"e21ca99a-bdb3-4c1e-b0e5-9316d4868877","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b1ffb1f7-c7f1-4973-baa2-4d47a36f815f","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"2d24e7df-2089-4ac1-a93d-b324654abdf8"},{"children":[{"text":"看一个求阶乘的例子","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e4238e38-6bad-41ac-b300-d50a71fe7c16","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function factorial(n) {\n  if (n < 0) {\n    throw new Error(\"参数错误\");\n  }\n\n  if (n <= 1) {\n    return 1;\n  }\n\n  return n * factorial(n - 1);\n}","collabId":"b74a1cda-2f61-4f32-a3a1-0d9deecd19c6","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f284395d-b940-4508-b08a-50f3772b7e2c","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"4ad315a9-05bc-4942-a427-6a2243ef0a5b"},{"children":[{"text":"上面的函数无法进行尾优化，因为最后一条语句不是尾调用。现在我们换一种思路，将上面的函数转化为可以进行尾调用优化的函数","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"11a26c92-5185-42c9-9ad7-d7ee786ce1a7","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function factorial(n, result = 1) {\n  if (n < 0) {\n    throw new Error(\"参数错误\");\n  }\n\n  if (n <= 1) {\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  return factorial(n - 1, result * n);\n}","collabId":"509ffde6-876c-4ad1-bec1-6ee0b87afaeb","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"a489b9d7-3496-44e9-85cb-c927f45af02b","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"157e9e25-f794-47a8-875d-a9c9a200595e"}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690903681645,"updateTime":1793532521077,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532521077}}